{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02733","headline":"和太尉戏赠高阳公 · 上官仪","name":"和太尉戏赠高阳公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薰炉御史出神仙，云鞍羽盖下芝田。\n红尘正起浮桥路，青楼遥敞御沟前。\n倾城比态芳菲节，绝世相娇是六年。\n惯是洛滨要解佩，本是河间好数钱。\n翠钗照耀衔云发，玉步逶迤动罗袜。\n石榴绞带轻花转，桃枝绿扇微风发。\n无情拂袂欲留宾，讵恨深潭不可越。\n天津一别九秋长，岂若随闻三日香。\n南国自然胜掌上，东家复是忆王昌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}